WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.430
- I'm here today to share
some really good tips

00:00:02.430 --> 00:00:04.260
on organizing your pantry.

00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:06.930
So tip number one is to create zones.

00:00:06.930 --> 00:00:11.420
So I created for my family
a breakfast zone, dinner,

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:13.610
snacks, and sweet treats.

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:16.810
It really goes from
most used to least used,

00:00:16.810 --> 00:00:19.800
and I love that my kids can
kind of access this level.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:22.770
Tip number two is to categorize everything

00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:25.100
and place it in a bin or a container.

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:27.810
And it's kind of a must for us to label

00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:30.530
so that everybody knows
where to put things back.

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:33.890
And tip number three
is really just for you.

00:00:33.890 --> 00:00:35.950
When you're making that grocery list,

00:00:35.950 --> 00:00:39.160
make sure that you come
over to your actual pantry

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:41.763
and make the list by looking inside.

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:45.110
Trust me, you're gonna save
a ton of time and money

00:00:45.110 --> 00:00:47.010
when you go to the grocery store then.

00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:47.953
Happy organizing!

